OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,
OL,6,Fthundery showers will ease and clear
OL,7,Fsouthwards this evening, though some
OL,8,Fmay linger into the night towards the
OL,9,Fcoast. Clearer skies will bring a
OL,10,Frather cool night, especially in rural
OL,11,Fareas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FThe odd morning shower
OL,14,Fpossible in the east, otherwise a dry
OL,15,Fand bright day on Saturday with spells
OL,16,Fof sunshine. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
