OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FRemaining dry with sunny spells on
OL,7,FSunday and Monday. Showers and
OL,8,Fpossibly thunderstorms then moving in
OL,9,Ffrom the southwest on Tuesday. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarmer, especially in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
